{"step_index":349,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T06:49:51Z","thinking":"**Analyzing the Prompt's Details**\n\nI'm starting by carefully breaking down the provided user prompt. I need to understand the nuances of the UI/UX and architectural specification for \"Cùng Bé Bin Đi Máy Bay,\" especially across all eight levels. The thoroughness of the prompt is crucial for accurately developing this.\n\n\n**Defining the System Architecture**\n\nI'm now diving into the core architectural specifications. I'm focusing on the 4-layer structure across each of the 8 levels, analyzing the layout and functionality of the top bar, parent prompt banner, main play arena, and \"Tiếp tục\" button. The objective is to define character state rendering with the specific states for outfit, pose, expression, seatbelt, and holding state, and their mapping into appropriate character visualizations within the system. This includes integrating SFX. I need to make sure the interactions and visual feedback are intuitive and engaging.\n\n\n**Refining the Character Art**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on the artistic representation of Bin. Crucially, he'll stand directly in the scene without any surrounding white card or pedestals. I'm eliminating placeholder dots or pre-revealed correctness indicators from the start.\n\nI'm developing level 1 with a multi-layered composition so clothing changes are modular, and I'm updating my design for Level 5 with an initial 'seated_belt_open' state that directly renders Bin with a fastened seatbelt upon interaction, along with distinct poses for drinking and looking out the window for levels 5 and 6. I'm focusing on the animation for levels 7 with new 'whispering' and 'sitting_neat' poses.\n\n\n**Finalizing Level 8 Interaction**\n\nI'm finalizing the logic for Level 8. The starting state will be \"seated_belt_fastened\" as the plane moves. The unbuckle button will be inactive with the message \"Máy bay đang chạy vào chỗ đỗ...\". Once the plane stops, the button will become active. Unbuckling triggers the \"setSeatbelt('open')\" state and image change. Tapping the bear suitcase then leads to \"setPose('holding_badge')\" and the reward modal! Also, I've confirmed that no answers are revealed upfront in level 1, Bin starts undressed.\n\n\n**Developing Level 1 Further**\n\nI'm now iterating on Level 1, focusing on interaction feedback. My logic includes handling feedback for incorrect choices, using shake and prompt messages: \"Món này hơi bất tiện. Con thử món khác nhé!\" For correct choices, I've developed the item packing animation, triggering the \"Next Level\" button once all outfit categories are completed. I'm also ready to design Level 2, with suitcase packing, considering `PACK`, `ASK_PARENT`, and `LEAVE_HOME` categories. Finally, I've started the architecture for level 3 with the security stations.\n\n\n**Refining Level Interactions**\n\nI'm now implementing Levels 4-7. Level 4 focuses on matching the gate number, and I'm ensuring clear visual feedback with gate illumination and Bin's positive reaction when the correct gate is selected. In Level 5, the seatbelt fastening is key, with an audible `CẠCH` sound and a visible belt. Level 6 features cloud identification, prompting interactive discovery, and Level 7 features volume controls.\n\n\n**Implementing Level 7 and 8**\n\nI've finalized Level 7 with the volume controls. Now I'm focusing on Level 8, mapping out the plane parking, seatbelt unbuckling, and suitcase selection. The red bear suitcase interaction now triggers the celebration with Bin holding the airplane model and medal. I'm also ensuring the parent gate interface, accessible with a 3-second hold, includes volume control, reduced motion toggle, level jump, reset, and short tips. I'll need to double check assets.\n\n\n**Verifying Asset Integrity**\n\nI'm now verifying the integrity of Bé Bin's assets. I've confirmed the existence and correct naming of specific shirt, pant, and shoe SVGs for Level 1, ensuring consistency with the Character Bible. I'm also confirming I have the necessary poses, like pointing, seated open/fastened, and drinking water.\n\n\n**Validating SVG Asset Integrity**\n\nI'm now deep-diving into the integrity of Bé Bin's assets. I've verified the existence of images for looking out the window, whispering, and holding a badge. Crucially, I'm checking `bin_base.svg`, along with shirt, pant, and shoe SVGs, specifically `shirt_soft.svg`, `pants_soft.svg`, and `shoes_velcro.svg` in `assets/characters/bin/dress/`. I need to ensure these SVGs render perfectly with the specified `viewBox`. I'm going to create new layer SVGs for Level 1 that accurately represent the `BIN_SOFT_STORYBOOK_2D_V1` style with the exact colors.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 600\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">\n  <defs>\n    <!-- Bảng màu chuẩn BIN_SOFT_STORYBOOK_2D_V1 -->\n    <linearGradient id=\"skinGradient\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#FFE7D6\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#FCD5BE\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <filter id=\"softShading\" x=\"-10%\" y=\"-10%\" width=\"120%\" height=\"120%\">\n      <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"4\" stdDeviation=\"4\" flood-color=\"#514B48\" flood-opacity=\"0.12\"/>\n    </filter>\n  </defs>\n\n  <g id=\"bin-base-body\" filter=\"url(#softShading)\">\n    <!-- Đôi chân (Cẳng chân và bàn chân mộc) -->\n    <rect x=\"138\" y=\"420\" width=\"34\" height=\"110\" rx=\"17\" fill=\"url(#skinGradient)\" stroke=\"#514B48\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/>\n    <rect x=\"228\" y=\"420\" width=\"34\" height=\"110\" rx=\"17\" fill=\"url(#skinGradient)\" stroke=\"#514B48\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/>\n    \n    <!-- Bàn chân mộc có tất trắng cổ thấp -->\n    <ellipse cx=\"150\" cy=\"535\" rx=\"26\" ry=\"16\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#514B48\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n    <ellipse cx=\"250\" cy=\"535\" rx=\"26\" ry=\"16\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#514B48\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n\n    <!-- Thân mình cơ bản (Áo lót / Neutral Base) -->\n    <rect x=\"125\" y=\"240\" width=\"150\" height=\"180\" rx=\"28\" fill=\"#FFFDE7\" stroke=\"#514B48\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/>\n\n    <!-- Cánh tay trái và phải -->\n    <rect x=\"85\" y=\"250\" width=\"34\" height=\"120\" rx=\"17\" transform=\"rotate(12 85 250)\" fill=\"url(#skinGradient)\" stroke=\"#514B48\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/>\n    <rect x=\"280\" y=\"250\" width=\"34\" height=\"120\" rx=\"17\" transform=\"rotate(-12 280 250)\" fill=\"url(#skinGradient)\" stroke=\"#514B48\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"95\" cy=\"385\" r=\"16\" fill=\"url(#skinGradient)\" stroke=\"#514B48\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"305\" cy=\"385\" r=\"16\" fill=\"url(#skinGradient)\" stroke=\"#514B48\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n\n    <!-- Đầu tròn Bé Bin (Tỉ lệ 3.8 - 4 đầu) -->\n    <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"140\" r=\"82\" fill=\"url(#skinGradient)\" stroke=\"#514B48\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"118\" cy=\"145\" r=\"16\" fill=\"url(#skinGradient)\" stroke=\"#514B48\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"282\" cy=\"145\" r=\"16\" fill=\"url(#skinGradient)\" stroke=\"#514B48\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n\n    <!-- Tóc đen nâu ngắn, bồng bềnh và có chỏm tóc cong nhẹ trên đỉnh đầu -->\n    <path d=\"M 118 120 C 118 55, 282 55, 282 120 C 270 95, 230 85, 200 100 C 170 85, 130 95, 118 120 Z\" fill=\"#42332B\" stroke=\"#514B48\" stroke-width=\"3.5\"/>\n    <!-- Chỏm tóc cong nhẹ chuẩn Character Bible -->\n    <path d=\"M 196 60 Q 212 30 226 44 Q 216 60 206 66 Z\" fill=\"#42332B\" stroke=\"#514B48\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n\n    <!-- Mắt nâu đậm, tròn vừa phải, thân thiện -->\n    <ellipse cx=\"166\" cy=\"138\" rx=\"8.5\" ry=\"10\" fill=\"#3E2723\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"163\" cy=\"134\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/>\n    <ellipse cx=\"234\" cy=\"138\" rx=\"8.5\" ry=\"10\" fill=\"#3E2723\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"231\" cy=\"134\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/>\n\n    <!-- Lông mày ngắn mềm mại -->\n    <path d=\"M 154 120 Q 166 114 178 120\" stroke=\"#42332B\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/>\n    <path d=\"M 222 120 Q 234 114 246 120\" stroke=\"#42332B\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/>\n\n    <!-- Mũi nhỏ -->\n    <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"148\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#E5A687\"/>\n\n    <!-- Má hồng hào đáng yêu -->\n    <circle cx=\"146\" cy=\"155\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#FF8A80\" opacity=\"0.55\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"254\" cy=\"155\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#FF8A80\" opacity=\"0.55\"/>\n\n    <!-- Nụ cười tươi vui vẻ -->\n    <path d=\"M 182 158 Q 200 178 218 158\" stroke=\"#514B48\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"#E57373\"/>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n","Description":"Tạo layer Base Body Bé Bin chuẩn Style BIN_SOFT_STORYBOOK_2D_V1 (bin_base.svg)","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"c:\\Demo.plane\\assets\\characters\\bin\\dress\\bin_base.svg","toolAction":"Writing file","toolSummary":"Create Storybook 2D bin_base.svg"}}]}
