{"step_index":357,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T06:51:15Z","thinking":"**Analyzing Character Renderer**\n\nI've been examining `js/character-renderer.js`. I've verified the initial `characterState` object structure for outfits, poses, etc. The next focus is on the Level 1 Outfit Layer System, which begins by rendering `bin_base.svg`. My attention is now on its rendering process.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/**\n * character-renderer.js - Character State Renderer for Bé Bin\n * Chuẩn Style BIN_SOFT_STORYBOOK_2D_V1\n * - Level 1: Hệ Layer trong suốt (Base + Shirt + Pants + Shoes) đứng trực tiếp trong phòng (không khung card trắng)\n * - Level 2-8: Duy trì trạng thái và chuyển đổi Pose artwork 2D Storybook chính xác\n */\n\nclass CharacterRenderer {\n    constructor() {\n        // State ban đầu của Bé Bin: ban đầu Level 1 chưa mặc đồ ngoài (chưa chọn)\n        this.characterState = {\n            outfit: {\n                shirt: null,  // 'soft' | null\n                pants: null,  // 'soft' | null\n                shoes: null   // 'velcro' | null\n            },\n            pose: 'standing', // 'standing' | 'pointing' | 'seated' | 'drinking_water' | 'looking_window' | 'whispering' | 'sitting_neat' | 'holding_badge'\n            expression: 'normal',\n            seatbelt: 'none', // 'none' | 'open' | 'fastened'\n            holding: null\n        };\n\n        // Bảng ánh xạ Asset Layer và Artwork Storybook 2D\n        this.assetManifest = {\n            layers: {\n                baseBody: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/bin_base.svg',\n                shirtSoft: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/shirts/shirt_soft.svg',\n                pantsSoft: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/pants/pants_soft.svg',\n                shoesVelcro: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/shoes/shoes_velcro.svg'\n            },\n            storybookPoses: {\n                standing: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_point_right_1787725750609.jpg',\n                pointing: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_point_right_1787725750609.jpg',\n                seated_open: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_seated_plane_1787725580022.jpg',\n                seated_fastened: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_seatbelt_fastened_1787725612313.jpg',\n                drinking_water: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_drink_water_1787725639196.jpg',\n                looking_window: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_looking_window_1787725671427.jpg',\n                whispering: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_whisper_sitting_1787725691994.jpg',\n                sitting_neat: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_whisper_sitting_1787725691994.jpg',\n                holding_badge: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_holding_badge_1787725718575.jpg'\n            }\n        };\n\n        this.init();\n    }\n\n    init() {\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // PUBLIC STATE API (GỌI TỪ GAMEPLAY CONTROLLER)\n    // ==========================================================================\n\n    setShirt(value) {\n        this.characterState.outfit.shirt = value;\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    setPants(value) {\n        this.characterState.outfit.pants = value;\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    setShoes(value) {\n        this.characterState.outfit.shoes = value;\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    setOutfit(outfitObj) {\n        if (!outfitObj) return;\n        if (outfitObj.shirt !== undefined) this.characterState.outfit.shirt = outfitObj.shirt;\n        if (outfitObj.pants !== undefined) this.characterState.outfit.pants = outfitObj.pants;\n        if (outfitObj.shoes !== undefined) this.characterState.outfit.shoes = outfitObj.shoes;\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    setPose(poseName) {\n        this.characterState.pose = poseName;\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    setSeatbelt(seatbeltState) {\n        this.characterState.seatbelt = seatbeltState; // 'none' | 'open' | 'fastened'\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    setHolding(item) {\n        this.characterState.holding = item;\n        if (item === 'water') {\n            this.setPose('drinking_water');\n        } else if (item === 'badge') {\n            this.setPose('holding_badge');\n        } else {\n            this.updateAll();\n        }\n    }\n\n    reset() {\n        this.characterState = {\n            outfit: { shirt: null, pants: null, shoes: null },\n            pose: 'standing',\n            expression: 'normal',\n            seatbelt: 'none',\n            holding: null\n        };\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // RENDER ENGINE\n    // ==========================================================================\n\n    renderTo(containerEl, customMode = null, customSeatbelt = null) {\n        if (!containerEl) return;\n\n        const effectiveMode = customMode || this.characterState.pose;\n        const effectiveSeatbelt = customSeatbelt !== null ? customSeatbelt : this.characterState.seatbelt;\n\n        containerEl.innerHTML = '';\n        containerEl.classList.add('bin-character-frame');\n\n        if (effectiveMode === 'level1_layers') {\n            // HỆ LAYER LEVEL 1: ĐỨNG TRỰC TIẾP TRONG PHÒNG KHÔNG KHUNG TRẮNG\n            const wrapper = document.createElement('div');\n            wrapper.className = 'bin-layered-stack';\n\n            // 1. Layer Base Body\n            const baseImg = document.createElement('img');\n            baseImg.className = 'bin-layer bin-layer-base';\n            baseImg.src = this.assetManifest.layers.baseBody;\n            baseImg.alt = 'Bé Bin Base Body';\n            wrapper.appendChild(baseImg);\n\n            // 2. Layer Giày (nếu đã chọn)\n            if (this.characterState.outfit.shoes === 'velcro') {\n                const shoesImg = document.createElement('img');\n                shoesImg.className = 'bin-layer bin-layer-shoes pop-in-soft';\n                shoesImg.src = this.assetManifest.layers.shoesVelcro;\n                shoesImg.alt = 'Giày dán xé';\n                wrapper.appendChild(shoesImg);\n            }\n\n            // 3. Layer Quần (nếu đã chọn)\n            if (this.characterState.outfit.pants === 'soft') {\n                const pantsImg = document.createElement('img');\n                pantsImg.className = 'bin-layer bin-layer-pants pop-in-soft';\n                pantsImg.src = this.assetManifest.layers.pantsSoft;\n                pantsImg.alt = 'Quần thun mềm';\n                wrapper.appendChild(pantsImg);\n            }\n\n            // 4. Layer Áo (nếu đã chọn)\n            if (this.characterState.outfit.shirt === 'soft') {\n                const shirtImg = document.createElement('img');\n                shirtImg.className = 'bin-layer bin-layer-shirt pop-in-soft';\n                shirtImg.src = this.assetManifest.layers.shirtSoft;\n                shirtImg.alt = 'Áo thun mềm';\n                wrapper.appendChild(shirtImg);\n            }\n\n            containerEl.appendChild(wrapper);\n        } else {\n            // LEVEL 2–8: POSE 2D STORYBOOK ARTWORK CHUẨN ĐỒNG BỘ\n            let poseKey = effectiveMode;\n            if (effectiveMode === 'seated') {\n                poseKey = effectiveSeatbelt === 'fastened' ? 'seated_fastened' : 'seated_open';\n            }\n\n            const poseSrc = this.assetManifest.storybookPoses[poseKey] || this.assetManifest.storybookPoses.standing;\n            const wrapper = document.createElement('div');\n            wrapper.className = 'bin-layered-stack';\n\n            const poseImg = document.createElement('img');\n            poseImg.className = 'bin-layer bin-layer-pose pop-in-soft';\n            poseImg.src = poseSrc;\n            poseImg.alt = `Bé Bin ${effectiveMode}`;\n            wrapper.appendChild(poseImg);\n\n            containerEl.appendChild(wrapper);\n        }\n    }\n\n    updateAll() {\n        // 1. Mount point Level 1: Layer System trực tiếp trong phòng\n        const lvl1Mount = document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl1');\n        if (lvl1Mount) this.renderTo(lvl1Mount, 'level1_layers');\n\n        // 2. Mount point Level 3 Cổng An Ninh\n        const lvl3Mount = document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl3');\n        if (lvl3Mount) this.renderTo(lvl3Mount, 'pointing');\n\n        // 3. Mount point Level 5 Ghế Ngồi Khoang Bay\n        const lvl5Mount = document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl5');\n        if (lvl5Mount) {\n            const pose5 = this.characterState.pose === 'drinking_water' ? 'drinking_water' : 'seated';\n            this.renderTo(lvl5Mount, pose5, this.characterState.seatbelt);\n        }\n\n        // 4. Mount point Level 6 Nhìn Cửa Sổ\n        const lvl6Mount = document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl6');\n        if (lvl6Mount) this.renderTo(lvl6Mount, 'looking_window');\n\n        // 5. Mount point Level 7 Lịch Sự\n        const lvl7Mount = document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl7');\n        if (lvl7Mount) {\n            const pose7 = this.characterState.pose === 'whispering' ? 'whispering' : (this.characterState.pose === 'sitting_neat' ? 'sitting_neat' : 'seated');\n            this.renderTo(lvl7Mount, pose7, 'fastened');\n        }\n\n        // 6. Mount point Level 8 Nhận Thưởng\n        const lvl8Mount = document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl8');\n        if (lvl8Mount) {\n            const pose8 = this.characterState.pose === 'holding_badge' ? 'holding_badge' : 'standing';\n            this.renderTo(lvl8Mount, pose8);\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// Khởi tạo instance toàn cục\nwindow.binRenderer = new CharacterRenderer();\n","Description":"Cập nhật character-renderer.js hỗ trợ Layer Level 1 trực tiếp không card trắng và Storybook Poses Level 2-8","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"c:\\Demo.plane\\js\\character-renderer.js","toolAction":"Writing file","toolSummary":"Update character-renderer.js"}}]}
