{"step_index":359,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T06:51:41Z","thinking":"**Inspecting CSS Elements**\n\nI'm now diving into `css/style.css`. My immediate focus is on removing the white card/pedestal wrapping the bin element in Level 1 and everywhere else. I am checking `.bin-stage-pedestal` at the moment, and inspecting the style rules set for the relevant class.\n\n\n**Refining Visual Presentation**\n\nNow I'm digging deeper into `.bin-stage-pedestal`. I intend to make it and `.bin-character-stage` fully transparent, removing any white background and borders, to have the bin stand directly on the room floor. Simultaneously, I will make sure the Level 1 items within `.wardrobe-cabinet-art` have accessible touch targets, and that there are no pre-ticked elements. I'm aiming for clean, responsive styling that fits within standard screen resolutions. I will now update `css/style.css`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/* ==========================================================================\n   CÙNG BÉ BIN ĐI MÁY BAY - 2D STORYBOOK INTERACTIVE UI/UX (BIN_SOFT_STORYBOOK_2D_V1)\n   - 100% Không khung card trắng bao quanh Bin\n   - Không lộ đáp án trước khi thao tác\n   - Tối ưu chạm lớn (>=70px), không SpeechSynthesis, giữ Web Audio SFX\n   - Responsive hoàn hảo 1366x768 & 1920x1080 không scroll dọc gameplay\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n:root {\n    --color-sky-blue: #73C7E8;\n    --color-warm-orange: #F5A45D;\n    --color-cream-yellow: #F8D978;\n    --color-soft-green: #82C99A;\n    --color-coral-pink: #EFA49A;\n    --color-suitcase-red: #E75B52;\n    --outline-brown: #514B48;\n    --text-dark: #37474F;\n    --shadow-soft: 0 6px 14px rgba(81, 75, 72, 0.14);\n    --shadow-chunky: 0 6px 0 rgba(81, 75, 72, 0.18), 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n    --radius-round: 9999px;\n    --radius-story: 28px;\n\n    /* Master Family Reference Sprite Sheet */\n    --char-sprite: url('file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/family_reference_sheet_1787726171083.jpg');\n}\n\n* {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n    user-select: none;\n    -webkit-user-select: none;\n}\n\nbody, html {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    font-family: \"Nunito\", \"Arial Rounded MT Bold\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n    background: #E1F5FE;\n    color: var(--text-dark);\n    touch-action: manipulation;\n}\n\n#app-root {\n    width: 100vw;\n    height: 100vh;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n#effects-canvas {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    z-index: 1000;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   TẦNG 1: THANH TIẾN TRÌNH (8 CHẶNG NHỎ & NÚT BA MẸ)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.top-nav {\n    height: 52px;\n    padding: 4px 16px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    z-index: 50;\n}\n\n.stage-indicators {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 8px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n    padding: 4px 12px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-round);\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\n    border: 2px solid #FFF;\n}\n\n.stage-dot {\n    width: 36px;\n    height: 36px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #ECEFF1;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n    box-shadow: inset 0 -3px 0 #CFD8DC;\n    border: none;\n}\n\n.stage-dot.active {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F8D978 0%, #F5A45D 100%);\n    transform: scale(1.18);\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(245, 164, 93, 0.45), inset 0 -3px 0 #E67E22;\n}\n\n.stage-dot.completed {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #A5D6A7 0%, #82C99A 100%);\n    box-shadow: inset 0 -3px 0 #66BB6A;\n}\n\n.stage-dot.locked {\n    opacity: 0.35;\n    cursor: not-allowed;\n    filter: grayscale(0.8);\n}\n\n/* NÚT BẤM STORYBOOK BO TRÒN */\n.tycoon-btn {\n    min-width: 60px;\n    min-height: 44px;\n    padding: 6px 18px;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-round);\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    color: var(--text-dark);\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    box-shadow: 0 5px 0 #CFD8DC, 0 8px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n    transition: all 0.12s ease;\n    touch-action: manipulation;\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn:active:not(:disabled) {\n    transform: translateY(3px);\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #CFD8DC;\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn:disabled {\n    cursor: not-allowed;\n    opacity: 0.6;\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn-green {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #82C99A 0%, #66BB6A 100%);\n    color: #1B5E20;\n    box-shadow: 0 5px 0 #43A047, 0 8px 18px rgba(67, 160, 71, 0.3);\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn-green:active:not(:disabled) {\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #43A047;\n}\n\n.tycoon-btn-primary {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F8D978 0%, #F5A45D 100%);\n    color: #5D4037;\n    box-shadow: 0 5px 0 #E67E22, 0 8px 18px rgba(230, 126, 34, 0.3);\n}\n\n/* Cổng Ba Mẹ: Vòng giữ 3 giây */\n.parent-gate-btn {\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.parent-hold-ring {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    transform: rotate(-90deg);\n}\n\n.parent-hold-ring circle {\n    fill: none;\n    stroke: #FF7043;\n    stroke-width: 5;\n    stroke-dasharray: 175;\n    stroke-dashoffset: 175;\n    transition: stroke-dashoffset 0.1s linear;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   TẦNG 2: BIỂN BÁO LỜI THOẠI BA MẸ ĐỌC (PARENT PROMPT BANNER)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.parent-prompt-container {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 860px;\n    margin: 0 auto 4px auto;\n    padding: 0 16px;\n    z-index: 40;\n}\n\n.parent-prompt-signboard {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    padding: 6px 18px;\n    border: 3px solid #FFE082;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #FFCA28, var(--shadow-soft);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n\n.prompt-avatar-sprite {\n    width: 46px;\n    height: 46px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 3px solid #F5A45D;\n    box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);\n    background-image: var(--char-sprite);\n    background-repeat: no-repeat;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.prompt-avatar-sprite.speaker-mom {\n    background-size: 500% auto;\n    background-position: 29.5% 18%;\n    border-color: #EFA49A;\n}\n\n.prompt-avatar-sprite.speaker-dad {\n    background-size: 500% auto;\n    background-position: 53.5% 18%;\n    border-color: #82C99A;\n}\n\n.prompt-avatar-sprite.speaker-bin {\n    background-size: 500% auto;\n    background-position: 8.5% 18%;\n    border-color: #F5A45D;\n}\n\n.prompt-avatar-sprite.speaker-attendant {\n    background-size: 500% auto;\n    background-position: 94.5% 18%;\n    border-color: #00897B;\n}\n\n.prompt-speech-text {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: var(--text-dark);\n    line-height: 1.3;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   TẦNG 3: KHU CHƠI CHÍNH (8 MÀN CHƠI - BACKGROUND ARTWORK + BIN + OBJECTS)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.screens-viewport {\n    flex: 1;\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: calc(100vh - 110px);\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.screen {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    opacity: 0;\n    visibility: hidden;\n    transform: scale(0.97);\n    transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.25, 0.64, 1), visibility 0.3s;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 6px 16px 12px 16px;\n    background-size: cover;\n    background-position: center;\n    background-repeat: no-repeat;\n}\n\n.screen.active {\n    opacity: 1;\n    visibility: visible;\n    transform: scale(1);\n}\n\n#screen-1 { background-image: url('file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bg_home_1787718137754.jpg'); }\n#screen-2 { background-image: url('file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bg_packing_1787718200559.jpg'); }\n#screen-3 { background-image: url('file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bg_security_1787718222484.jpg'); }\n#screen-4 { background-image: url('file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bg_gate_1787718278394.jpg'); }\n#screen-5 { background-image: url('file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bg_cabin_1787718301171.jpg'); }\n#screen-6 { background-image: url('file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bg_clouds_1787718325129.jpg'); }\n#screen-7 { background-image: url('file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bg_etiquette_1787718349034.jpg'); }\n#screen-8 { background-image: url('file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bg_baggage_1787718391144.jpg'); }\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   CHARACTER RENDERER: HỆ THỐNG LAYER ĐỨNG TRỰC TIẾP TRONG PHÒNG\n   ========================================================================== */\n.bin-character-frame {\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.bin-layered-stack {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.bin-layer {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: contain;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.bin-layer-base { z-index: 10; }\n.bin-layer-shoes { z-index: 20; }\n.bin-layer-pants { z-index: 30; }\n.bin-layer-shirt { z-index: 40; }\n.bin-layer-pose { z-index: 35; }\n\n.pop-in-soft {\n    animation: popInSoft 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) forwards;\n}\n\n@keyframes popInSoft {\n    0% { transform: scale(0.94); opacity: 0.7; }\n    100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 1: WARDROBE ARENA (KHÔNG KHUNG TRẮNG QUANH BIN)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.wardrobe-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 980px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;\n    gap: 24px;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin: auto 0;\n}\n\n.wardrobe-cabinet-art {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n    border: 4px solid #FFE082;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-story);\n    padding: 12px;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.clothes-tile-art {\n    min-height: 90px;\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    border: 3px solid #CFD8DC;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #B0BEC5, 0 6px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 6px;\n    cursor: grab;\n    touch-action: none;\n    transition: transform 0.18s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.clothes-tile-art:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.04);\n}\n\n.clothes-tile-art:active {\n    cursor: grabbing;\n    transform: scale(1.15);\n    z-index: 100;\n}\n\n.clothes-tile-art.shake-wobble {\n    animation: springShake 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.36, 0.07, 0.19, 0.97) both;\n    border-color: #E75B52 !important;\n}\n\n.item-img-art {\n    width: 62px;\n    height: 62px;\n    object-fit: contain;\n    pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.item-label-tag {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: var(--text-dark);\n    margin-top: 3px;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n\n/* Sân khấu Bé Bin Level 1: ĐỨNG TRỰC TIẾP TRONG PHÒNG, KHÔNG KHUNG CARD TRẮNG */\n.bin-character-stage {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.bin-stage-pedestal {\n    width: 260px;\n    height: 380px;\n    background: none;\n    border: none;\n    box-shadow: none;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.bin-mount-lvl1 {\n    width: 250px;\n    height: 370px;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 2: CHIẾC VALI KỲ DIỆU (PACK / ASK_PARENT / LEAVE_HOME)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.suitcase-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 880px;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 20px;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin: auto 0;\n}\n\n.clothes-tile {\n    width: 110px;\n    height: 90px;\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    border: 3px solid #CFD8DC;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #B0BEC5, 0 6px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    cursor: grab;\n    touch-action: none;\n    transition: transform 0.18s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n    padding: 6px;\n}\n\n.clothes-tile:hover { transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.04); }\n\n.clothes-tile.shake-wobble {\n    animation: springShake 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.36, 0.07, 0.19, 0.97) both;\n}\n\n.suitcase-box-red {\n    width: 280px;\n    height: 290px;\n    border-radius: 36px;\n    border: 5px solid #8E0000;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 0 #5f0000, var(--shadow-chunky);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 12px;\n    position: relative;\n    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.suitcase-box-red.packed-bounce {\n    animation: popBounce 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.suitcase-inner-grid {\n    width: 100%;\n    flex: 1;\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    border: 3px dashed #E75B52;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n    grid-template-rows: repeat(2, 1fr);\n    gap: 8px;\n    padding: 8px;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-items: center;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 3: KIỂM TRA AN NINH (3 TRẠM TRÁI SANG PHẢI)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.security-station-grid {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 920px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 16px;\n    margin: auto 0;\n}\n\n.station-pod {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-story);\n    border: 3px solid #B3E5FC;\n    padding: 14px;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #81D4FA, var(--shadow-soft);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.officer-avatar-crop {\n    width: 56px;\n    height: 56px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background-image: var(--char-sprite);\n    background-size: 500% auto;\n    background-position: 94.5% 18%;\n    border: 3px solid #00897B;\n}\n\n.boarding-pass-chunky {\n    width: 160px;\n    height: 90px;\n    background: #FFF9C4;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    border: 3px dashed #FFB300;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n    padding: 8px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    transition: transform 0.2s;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.boarding-pass-chunky:hover { transform: scale(1.04); }\n\n.stamp-badge {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-15deg) scale(0);\n    border: 3px solid #43A047;\n    color: #2E7D32;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    padding: 4px 10px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    opacity: 0;\n    background: #E8F5E9;\n    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.stamp-badge.stamped {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-15deg) scale(1.1);\n    animation: stampSlam 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) forwards;\n}\n\n.xray-screen-neon {\n    width: 180px;\n    height: 100px;\n    background: #00251A;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    border: 3px solid #00E676;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 14px rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.4);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    padding: 6px;\n}\n\n.xray-tap-box {\n    width: 46px;\n    height: 46px;\n    background: #00E676;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 24px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 10px #00E676;\n    transition: transform 0.2s;\n}\n\n.xray-tap-box:hover { transform: scale(1.1); }\n.xray-tap-box.revealed-pulse { animation: popBounce 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1); }\n\n.gate-detector-chunky {\n    width: 130px;\n    height: 170px;\n    border: 12px solid #78909C;\n    border-bottom: none;\n    border-radius: 20px 20px 0 0;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    background: rgba(236, 239, 241, 0.6);\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.gate-lamps-row {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -20px;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 14px;\n}\n\n.gate-lamp-led {\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 20px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #CFD8DC;\n    border: 2px solid #546E7A;\n}\n\n.gate-lamp-led.green-flash {\n    background: #00E676;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 16px #00E676;\n    animation: lamp-blink 0.25s alternate 6;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 4: RA CỔNG BAY (TÌM CỔNG 03)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.boarding-hall-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 14px;\n    margin: auto 0;\n}\n\n.gates-array-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.gate-pillar {\n    width: 130px;\n    height: 130px;\n    background: #263238;\n    color: #F8D978;\n    border: 4px solid #455A64;\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #102027;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-family: monospace;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.gate-pillar:hover { transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.04); }\n\n.gate-pillar.matched {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2E7D32 0%, #1B5E20 100%);\n    border-color: #00E676;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #004D40, 0 0 20px #00E676;\n    animation: popBounce 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.gate-pillar.shake-wobble {\n    animation: springShake 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.36, 0.07, 0.19, 0.97) both;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 5: HIỆP SĨ ĐAI AN TOÀN & UỐNG NƯỚC (BIN SEATED TRỰC TIẾP)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.cabin-seat-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 880px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 20px;\n    align-items: center;\n    margin: auto 0;\n}\n\n.seat-plush-box {\n    border-radius: 36px;\n    padding: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.bin-mount-lvl5 {\n    width: 220px;\n    height: 270px;\n}\n\n.safety-sign-led {\n    background: #E75B52;\n    color: white;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    padding: 3px 14px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-round);\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    transition: background 0.3s;\n}\n\n.safety-sign-led.green-safe {\n    background: #43A047;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 16px #00E676;\n}\n\n.knight-cape-icon {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 40px;\n    font-size: 48px;\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: scale(0.5);\n    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.knight-cape-icon.active {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: scale(1);\n    animation: gentle-sway 1.5s infinite;\n}\n\n.seatbelt-straps-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n    height: 64px;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.strap-left, .strap-right {\n    height: 44px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    cursor: grab;\n    touch-action: none;\n    transition: transform 0.2s;\n}\n\n.strap-left {\n    background: #37474F;\n    width: 85px;\n    border-radius: 8px 0 0 8px;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.buckle-insert {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: -16px;\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 28px;\n    background: #B0BEC5;\n    border: 3px solid #78909C;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n}\n\n.strap-right {\n    background: #37474F;\n    width: 85px;\n    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;\n    position: relative;\n}\n\n.buckle-receiver {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: -16px;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 38px;\n    background: #90A4AE;\n    border: 3px solid #546E7A;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.seatbelt-buckled .strap-left {\n    transform: translateX(16px) !important;\n}\n\n.seatbelt-buckled .buckle-receiver {\n    background: #00E676;\n    border-color: #00BFA5;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 16px #00E676;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 6: NGẮM MÂY BIẾN HÌNH (BIN LOOKING WINDOW)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.cloud-stage-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr;\n    gap: 18px;\n    align-items: center;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 920px;\n    margin: auto 0;\n}\n\n.cloud-window-frame {\n    height: 290px;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #73C7E8 0%, #B3E5FC 60%, #E1F5FE 100%);\n    border-radius: 40px;\n    border: 12px solid #ECEFF1;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15), 0 10px 0 #CFD8DC, var(--shadow-soft);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    padding: 8px;\n}\n\n.morph-cloud-tile {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);\n    border-radius: 36px;\n    padding: 14px 22px;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    border: 3px solid transparent;\n    transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.morph-cloud-tile:hover { transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.06); }\n\n.morph-cloud-tile.morphed {\n    background: #FFF9C4;\n    border-color: #F8D978;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 20px #F8D978;\n    animation: gentle-bounce 0.6s infinite alternate;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 7: MÓN QUÀ LỊCH SỰ (3 MỨC ÂM LƯỢNG CÓ CHỮ + THU CHÂN)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.etiquette-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 20px;\n    margin: auto 0;\n}\n\n.etiquette-card-chunky {\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);\n    border-radius: var(--radius-story);\n    padding: 16px;\n    border: 3px solid #B3E5FC;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #81D4FA, var(--shadow-soft);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.volume-emotion-options {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.volume-emotion-btn {\n    width: 80px;\n    height: 76px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    background: #FFF;\n    border: 3px solid #CFD8DC;\n    box-shadow: 0 5px 0 #B0BEC5;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.volume-emotion-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.05); }\n\n.volume-emotion-btn span {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    line-height: 1;\n}\n\n.volume-emotion-btn small {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: var(--text-dark);\n    margin-top: 3px;\n}\n\n.volume-emotion-btn.selected {\n    transform: scale(1.12);\n    border-color: #43A047;\n    background: #E8F5E9;\n    box-shadow: 0 5px 0 #2E7D32, 0 0 14px #00E676;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   LEVEL 8: LẤY VALI & NHẬN PHẦN THƯỞNG (CAROUSEL & REWARD MODAL)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.carousel-final-arena {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 900px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n    margin: auto 0;\n}\n\n.carousel-track-chunky {\n    width: 90%;\n    height: 150px;\n    border: 14px solid #455A64;\n    border-radius: 75px;\n    background: #ECEFF1;\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n    overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.carousel-suitcases-track {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 28px;\n    position: absolute;\n    animation: carousel-orbit 14s linear infinite;\n}\n\n.carousel-suitcases-track.paused {\n    animation-play-state: paused;\n}\n\n.carousel-bag-tile {\n    width: 76px;\n    height: 86px;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    border: 3px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.carousel-bag-tile:hover { transform: scale(1.1); }\n.carousel-bag-tile:active { transform: scale(1.25) translateY(-8px); }\n\n.golden-medal-modal {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0.8);\n    opacity: 0;\n    visibility: hidden;\n    width: 90%;\n    max-width: 560px;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFDE7 0%, #FFF9C4 100%);\n    border-radius: 36px;\n    border: 6px solid #F8D978;\n    box-shadow: 0 16px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n    padding: 22px;\n    text-align: center;\n    z-index: 200;\n    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n.golden-medal-modal.show {\n    opacity: 1;\n    visibility: visible;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1);\n    animation: popBounce 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   CỔNG BA MẸ (PARENT CONTROL HUB)\n   ========================================================================== */\n.parent-modal-overlay {\n    position: fixed;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 100vw;\n    height: 100vh;\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);\n    z-index: 999;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    opacity: 0;\n    visibility: hidden;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.parent-modal-overlay.open {\n    opacity: 1;\n    visibility: visible;\n}\n\n.parent-control-card {\n    width: 90%;\n    max-width: 540px;\n    max-height: 88vh;\n    overflow-y: auto;\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    border-radius: 32px;\n    padding: 22px;\n    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);\n    border: 4px solid #F5A45D;\n}\n\n.parent-tip-box {\n    background: #FFF3E0;\n    border-left: 4px solid #F5A45D;\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    color: #4E342E;\n}\n\n.level-jump-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n    gap: 8px;\n    margin: 8px 0;\n}\n\n.jump-btn {\n    padding: 8px;\n    background: #ECEFF1;\n    border: 2px solid #CFD8DC;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: transform 0.15s;\n}\n\n.jump-btn:hover { transform: scale(1.04); }\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   KEYFRAME ANIMATIONS\n   ========================================================================== */\n@keyframes gentle-sway {\n    0%, 100% { transform: rotate(-2deg); }\n    50% { transform: rotate(2deg); }\n}\n\n@keyframes gentle-bounce {\n    0% { transform: translateY(0); }\n    100% { transform: translateY(-6px); }\n}\n\n@keyframes springShake {\n    10%, 90% { transform: translate3d(-3px, 0, 0) rotate(-3deg); }\n    20%, 80% { transform: translate3d(4px, 0, 0) rotate(3deg); }\n    30%, 50%, 70% { transform: translate3d(-5px, 0, 0) rotate(-2deg); }\n    40%, 60% { transform: translate3d(5px, 0, 0) rotate(2deg); }\n}\n\n@keyframes stampSlam {\n    0% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(2.4) rotate(-35deg); opacity: 0; }\n    50% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0.95) rotate(-10deg); opacity: 1; }\n    100% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.1) rotate(-15deg); opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n@keyframes popBounce {\n    0% { transform: scale(0.8); }\n    60% { transform: scale(1.18); }\n    100% { transform: scale(1); }\n}\n\n@keyframes lamp-blink {\n    0% { opacity: 0.3; }\n    100% { opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n@keyframes carousel-orbit {\n    0% { transform: translateX(0); }\n    100% { transform: translateX(-380px); }\n}\n\n.pop-in {\n    animation: popIn 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) forwards;\n}\n\n@keyframes popIn {\n    0% { transform: scale(0.7); opacity: 0; }\n    100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }\n}\n\n.hidden {\n    display: none !important;\n}\n\n/* ==========================================================================\n   RESPONSIVE OPTIMIZATIONS (1366x768, 1920x1080 & TABLET LANDSCAPE)\n   ========================================================================== */\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n    .wardrobe-arena, .suitcase-arena, .cabin-seat-arena, .etiquette-arena, .cloud-stage-grid {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 10px;\n    }\n    .bin-stage-pedestal {\n        width: 180px;\n        height: 250px;\n    }\n    .bin-mount-lvl1 {\n        width: 160px;\n        height: 230px;\n    }\n    .security-station-grid {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n    .parent-prompt-signboard {\n        padding: 5px 12px;\n    }\n    .prompt-speech-text {\n        font-size: 16px;\n    }\n    .prompt-avatar-sprite {\n        width: 38px;\n        height: 38px;\n    }\n}\n","Description":"Cập nhật style.css chuẩn Storybook 2D: không khung trắng quanh Bin, tối ưu layout không scroll","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"c:\\Demo.plane\\css\\style.css","toolAction":"Writing file","toolSummary":"Update style.css for Storybook 2D UI"}}]}
