{"step_index":361,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T06:52:16Z","thinking":"**Verifying HTML Structure**\n\nI'm currently validating the HTML structure of `index.html`. My focus is on ensuring the wardrobe cabinet contains the expected six items at level 1. I'm verifying each item's attributes, such as `data-fit` and `data-type`, to confirm they align with the specified criteria, specifically the soft t-shirt and the stiff jeans and the soft trousers.\n\n\n**Defining Level 2 Details**\n\nI'm now outlining Level 2's specifics, focusing on the suitcase's central placement. I'm noting the 6 items involved: three for packing (teddy bear, soft clothes, sun hat, and toothbrush), one to leave at home (sharp scissors), and one that needs parental input (large water bottle).\n\n\n**Analyzing Level Details**\n\nI've been analyzing the details for Levels 6, 7, and 8. Level 6 features a window with Bin looking out at cloud shapes. Level 7 introduces volume control with text and icons, and Bin's feet tapping triggers a pose. Finally, Level 8 is split into two parts: an airplane sequence with an unbuckling animation and a baggage carousel with a modal reward for Bin. I'm focusing on ensuring these level details are accurately represented. I've also checked `index.html` for pre-ticked badges and decided `.dressed-badges-overlay` can be removed.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"vi\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=3.0, user-scalable=yes, viewport-fit=cover\">\n    <title>Cùng Bé Bin Đi Máy Bay (Parent-Co-Play Interactive Book)</title>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@700;800;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div id=\"app-root\">\n        <!-- Canvas Pháo hoa, Sao lấp lánh & Trái tim -->\n        <canvas id=\"effects-canvas\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- TẦNG 1: TOP BAR - 8 CHẶNG TIẾN TRÌNH & CỔNG BA MẸ -->\n        <header class=\"top-nav\">\n            <nav class=\"stage-indicators\" aria-label=\"Tiến trình chuyến bay\">\n                <button class=\"stage-dot active\" data-screen=\"1\" aria-label=\"Chặng 1: Mặc đồ\">👕</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"2\" aria-label=\"Chặng 2: Xếp vali\">🧳</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"3\" aria-label=\"Chặng 3: Kiểm tra an ninh\">🎫</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"4\" aria-label=\"Chặng 4: Tìm Cổng Bay\">🚪</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"5\" aria-label=\"Chặng 5: Đai an toàn & Uống nước\">🦸</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"6\" aria-label=\"Chặng 6: Ngắm mây\">☁️</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"7\" aria-label=\"Chặng 7: Lịch sự\">🤫</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"8\" aria-label=\"Chặng 8: Nhận vali & Thưởng\">🏆</button>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Cổng Ba Mẹ (Giữ 3 giây để mở) -->\n            <button id=\"btn-parent-gate\" class=\"tycoon-btn parent-gate-btn\" aria-label=\"Cổng Ba Mẹ (Giữ 3 giây)\">\n                <svg class=\"parent-hold-ring\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n                    <circle id=\"parent-ring-circle\" cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"26\"></circle>\n                </svg>\n                ⚙️ <span>Ba Mẹ</span>\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- TẦNG 2: BIỂN BÁO LỜI THOẠI BA MẸ ĐỌC CHO BÉ (KHÔNG SPEECH SYNTHESIS) -->\n        <div class=\"parent-prompt-container\">\n            <div class=\"parent-prompt-signboard\">\n                <div id=\"parent-prompt-avatar\" class=\"prompt-avatar-sprite speaker-mom\"></div>\n                <span id=\"parent-prompt-text\" class=\"prompt-speech-text\">“Bin sắp đi máy bay rồi. Con chọn bộ đồ nào giúp Bin dễ vận động nhé!”</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- TẦNG 3: VIEWPORT 8 MÀN CHƠI CHÍNH (KHU CHƠI LỚN NHẤT) -->\n        <main class=\"screens-viewport\">\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 1: CHỌN TRANG PHỤC (KHÔNG KHUNG TRẮNG, KHÔNG LỘ ĐÁP ÁN)\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-1\" class=\"screen active\">\n                <div class=\"wardrobe-arena\">\n                    <!-- Tủ đồ bên trái gồm 6 món xáo trộn -->\n                    <div class=\"wardrobe-cabinet-art\">\n                        <!-- 1. Áo thun mềm (Soft) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"soft\" data-type=\"shirt\" aria-label=\"Áo thun mềm\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/shirt_soft_1787719072757.jpg\" class=\"item-img-art\" alt=\"Áo thun mềm\">\n                            <span class=\"item-label-tag\">Áo thun mềm</span>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <!-- 2. Quần bò cứng (Stiff) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"stiff\" data-type=\"jeans\" aria-label=\"Quần bò cứng\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/jeans_stiff_1787719123153.jpg\" class=\"item-img-art\" alt=\"Quần bò cứng\">\n                            <span class=\"item-label-tag\">Quần bò cứng</span>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <!-- 3. Quần thun mềm (Soft) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"soft\" data-type=\"pants\" aria-label=\"Quần thun mềm\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/pants_soft_1787719157043.jpg\" class=\"item-img-art\" alt=\"Quần thun mềm\">\n                            <span class=\"item-label-tag\">Quần thun mềm</span>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <!-- 4. Bộ yếm rườm rà (Stiff) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"stiff\" data-type=\"dress\" aria-label=\"Bộ yếm rườm rà\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/outfit_onepiece_1787719198691.jpg\" class=\"item-img-art\" alt=\"Bộ yếm rườm rà\">\n                            <span class=\"item-label-tag\">Bộ yếm rườm rà</span>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <!-- 5. Giày dán xé (Soft) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"soft\" data-type=\"shoes\" aria-label=\"Giày dán xé\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/shoes_velcro_1787719241323.jpg\" class=\"item-img-art\" alt=\"Giày dán xé\">\n                            <span class=\"item-label-tag\">Giày dán xé</span>\n                        </button>\n\n                        <!-- 6. Bốt dây cao cổ (Stiff) -->\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile-art\" data-clothing-item=\"true\" data-fit=\"stiff\" data-type=\"boots\" aria-label=\"Bốt dây cao cổ\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/boots_laces_1787719296706.jpg\" class=\"item-img-art\" alt=\"Bốt dây cao cổ\">\n                            <span class=\"item-label-tag\">Bốt cao cổ</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Bé Bin đứng trực tiếp trong căn phòng (Không khung trắng bao quanh) -->\n                    <div class=\"bin-character-stage\">\n                        <div id=\"bin-dress-target\" class=\"bin-stage-pedestal\">\n                            <div id=\"bin-character-mount-lvl1\" class=\"bin-mount-lvl1\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- TẦNG 4: NÚT TIẾP TỤC (CHỈ HIỆN KHI XONG NHIỆM VỤ) -->\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-1\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 19px; padding: 10px 28px; z-index: 50;\">\n                    ĐI XẾP VALI NÀO! 🧳 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 2: XẾP VALI (PACK / ASK_PARENT / LEAVE_HOME)\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-2\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"suitcase-arena\">\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;\">\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"PACK\" aria-label=\"Gấu bông\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/teddy_bear_1787718486091.jpg\" style=\"width: 52px; height: 52px; object-fit: contain;\" class=\"item-icon\" alt=\"Gấu bông\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800;\">Gấu bông</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"PACK\" aria-label=\"Quần áo mềm\">\n                            <img src=\"file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/shirt_soft_1787719072757.jpg\" style=\"width: 52px; height: 52px; object-fit: contain;\" class=\"item-icon\" alt=\"Quần áo mềm\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800;\">Quần áo</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"LEAVE_HOME\" aria-label=\"Kéo nhọn\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 38px;\">✂️</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800;\">Kéo nhọn</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div id=\"suitcase-target-lvl2\" class=\"suitcase-box-red\" style=\"background-image: url('file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/red_suitcase_1787718454138.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;\">\n                        <div id=\"suitcase-inner-lvl2\" class=\"suitcase-inner-grid\" style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;\">\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"PACK\" aria-label=\"Bàn chải\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 38px;\">🪥</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800;\">Bàn chải</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"ASK_PARENT\" aria-label=\"Bình nước lớn\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 38px;\">🍼</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800;\">Bình lớn</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"clothes-tile\" data-luggage-item=\"true\" data-category=\"PACK\" aria-label=\"Mũ che nắng\">\n                            <span class=\"item-icon\" style=\"font-size: 38px;\">👒</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800;\">Mũ che nắng</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-2\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 19px; padding: 10px 28px;\">\n                    ĐẾN SÂN BAY THÔI! 🚗 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 3: KIỂM TRA AN NINH (3 TRẠM TRÁI SANG PHẢI)\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-3\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"security-station-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"station-pod\">\n                        <div class=\"officer-avatar-crop\"></div>\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px; color: #1E88E5;\">1. KIỂM TRA VÉ</span>\n                        <div id=\"pass-card-lvl3\" class=\"boarding-pass-chunky\">\n                            <div style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: 900;\">✈️ VÉ CỦA BIN</div>\n                            <div style=\"font-size: 26px; text-align: center;\">🎟️</div>\n                            <div id=\"stamp-badge-lvl3\" class=\"stamp-badge\">ĐÃ DUYỆT ✓</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"station-pod\">\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px; color: #00897B;\">2. MÁY SOI CHIẾU</span>\n                        <div class=\"xray-screen-neon\">\n                            <div class=\"xray-tap-box\" data-item=\"🧸\">?</div>\n                            <div class=\"xray-tap-box\" data-item=\"👕\">?</div>\n                            <div class=\"xray-tap-box\" data-item=\"👒\">?</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"conveyor-belt\" style=\"width: 85%; margin-top: 6px;\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"station-pod\">\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 15px; color: #5E35B1;\">3. CỔNG AN NINH</span>\n                        <div id=\"gate-detector-lvl3\" class=\"gate-detector-chunky\">\n                            <div class=\"gate-lamps-row\">\n                                <div class=\"gate-lamp-led\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"gate-lamp-led\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div id=\"bin-character-mount-lvl3\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 130px;\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-3\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 19px; padding: 10px 28px;\">\n                    ĐI TÌM CỔNG BAY 🚪 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 4: RA CỔNG BAY (TẬP TRUNG TÌM CỔNG 03)\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-4\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"boarding-hall-arena\">\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 6px;\">\n                        <div class=\"boarding-pass-chunky\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 95px; background: #FFFDE7; border-color: #FFA000;\">\n                            <div style=\"font-size: 13px; font-weight: 900; color: #E65100;\">✈️ VÉ CỦA BÉ BIN</div>\n                            <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 24px;\">\n                                <div class=\"prompt-avatar-sprite speaker-bin\" style=\"width: 36px; height: 36px;\"></div> <strong>CỔNG 03</strong>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"gates-array-row\">\n                        <button class=\"gate-pillar\" data-gate=\"01\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">CỔNG</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 26px;\">01</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🥕</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"gate-pillar\" data-gate=\"02\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">CỔNG</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 26px;\">02</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🍯</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"gate-pillar\" data-gate=\"03\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">CỔNG</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 26px;\">03</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">✈️</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"gate-pillar\" data-gate=\"05\">\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">CỔNG</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 26px;\">05</span>\n                            <span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">🌲</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-4\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 19px; padding: 10px 28px;\">\n                    VÀO MÁY BAY THÔI! ✈️ ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 5: ĐAI AN TOÀN & UỐNG NƯỚC (BIN SEATED TRỰC TIẾP)\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-5\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"cabin-seat-arena\">\n                    <div class=\"seat-plush-box\">\n                        <div id=\"safety-sign-lvl5\" class=\"safety-sign-led\">ĐÈN BÁO CÀI ĐAI</div>\n                        <div id=\"bin-character-mount-lvl5\" class=\"bin-mount-lvl5\"></div>\n                        <div id=\"bin-knight-cape\" class=\"knight-cape-icon\">🦸‍♂️</div>\n                        <div class=\"ear-soundwave left hidden\">〰️</div>\n                        <div class=\"ear-soundwave right hidden\">〰️</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\">\n                        <div id=\"seatbelt-puzzle-lvl5\" class=\"seatbelt-puzzle\" style=\"background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95); border-radius: 24px; padding: 16px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\">\n                            <div class=\"seatbelt-straps-row\">\n                                <div id=\"seatbelt-strap-lvl5\" class=\"strap-left\">\n                                    <div class=\"buckle-insert\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"strap-right\">\n                                    <div class=\"buckle-receiver\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <button id=\"btn-drink-water-lvl5\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-primary hidden\" style=\"font-size: 18px; padding: 12px;\">\n                            🥤 Uống một ngụm nước\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-5\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 19px; padding: 10px 28px;\">\n                    NGẮM MÂY QUA CỬA SỔ! ☁️ ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 6: NGẮM MÂY BIẾN HÌNH (BIN LOOKING WINDOW)\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-6\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"cloud-stage-grid\">\n                    <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;\">\n                        <div id=\"bin-character-mount-lvl6\" style=\"width: 210px; height: 270px;\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"cloud-window-frame\">\n                        <button class=\"morph-cloud-tile\" data-morph=\"bunny\">\n                            <span class=\"cloud-icon\" style=\"font-size: 48px;\">☁️</span>\n                            <span class=\"cloud-label\" style=\"font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px; color: #0277BD;\">Mây số 1</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"morph-cloud-tile\" data-morph=\"car\">\n                            <span class=\"cloud-icon\" style=\"font-size: 48px;\">☁️</span>\n                            <span class=\"cloud-label\" style=\"font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px; color: #0277BD;\">Mây số 2</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"morph-cloud-tile\" data-morph=\"watermelon\">\n                            <span class=\"cloud-icon\" style=\"font-size: 48px;\">☁️</span>\n                            <span class=\"cloud-label\" style=\"font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px; color: #0277BD;\">Mây số 3</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"morph-cloud-tile\" data-morph=\"bear\">\n                            <span class=\"cloud-icon\" style=\"font-size: 48px;\">☁️</span>\n                            <span class=\"cloud-label\" style=\"font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px; color: #0277BD;\">Mây số 4</span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <button id=\"btn-next-level-6\" class=\"tycoon-btn tycoon-btn-green hidden\" style=\"margin-top: 10px; font-size: 19px; padding: 10px 28px;\">\n                    HỌC NÓI NHỎ NHÉ! 🤫 ➡️\n                </button>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- ==========================================================================\n                 LEVEL 7: LỊCH SỰ (3 MỨC ÂM LƯỢNG CÓ CHỮ & THU CHÂN)\n                 ========================================================================== -->\n            <section id=\"screen-7\" class=\"screen\">\n                <div class=\"etiquette-arena\">\n                    <div class=\"etiquette-card-chunky\">\n                        <div id=\"bin-character-mount-lvl7\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 230px;\"></div>\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 17px;\">NÓI NHỎ VỪA ĐỦ NGHE</span>\n                        <div class=\"volume-emotion-options\">\n                            <button class=\"volume-emotion-btn\" data-level=\"loud\" aria-label=\"Nói to\">\n                                <span>🔊</span>\n                                <small>NÓI TO</small>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"volume-emotion-btn\" data-level=\"medium\" aria-label=\"Nói vừa\">\n                                <span>🔉</span>\n                                <small>NÓI VỪA</small>\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"volume-emotion-btn\" data-level=\"whisper\" aria-label=\"Nói nhỏ\">\n                                <span>🤫</span>\n                                <small>NÓI NHỎ</small>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"etiquette-card-chunky\">\n                        <div style=\"font-size: 44px;\">💺</div>\n                        <span style=\"font-weight: 900; font-size: 17px;\">KHÔNG ĐẠP LƯNG GHẾ</span>\n                        <button id=\"bin-leg-target\" style=\"font-size: 46px; border: none; background: none; cursor: pointer;\" title=\"Chạm để thu chân\">\n                            👟🦶\n                        </button>\n                        <span id=\"leg-status-label\" style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #0277BD;\">Chạm để thu chân lại</